@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = change-me

### Health (no API key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get one by primary key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1785211070999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Exact-match filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?financialYear=1774928069228
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=2&limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 401 (missing key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Expect 404 (unknown model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 400 (field not in policy.filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?balance=100
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Expect 400 (limit above MAX_PAGE_SIZE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?limit=100000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
